m/users/jobfynder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created":false,"deleted":false,"base_ref":null,"compare":"https://github.com/jobfynder/hermes/compare/4aeb62fd5602...25853deffe74","commits":[{"id":"25853deffe7426cea05535914b56c8a9a2dda1c7","tree_id":"d4d469a163b8379b1b27b983cd193b03954ba5a3","distinct":true,"message":"feat(review): show the actual job title/candidate name in the drafts list, not \"Draft Job Requirement\"\n\nThe list and detail pages both rendered the drafts.title column\nverbatim. That column is a one-time snapshot taken at intake (or a\nreclassify) from _title_from_payload -- which for every draft created\nbefore the earlier job-title-generation fix, and any draft whose\njob_title/candidate_name field gets corrected afterward via inline\nediting, is stuck on the generic \"Draft Job Requirement\"/\"Draft\nHotlist\" fallback with no way to refresh short of a backend backfill.\n\ndraftDisplayTitle() (app/components/DraftTypeLabel.tsx) reads the title\nlive from the parsed record instead: job_title for a requirement, the\nsingle consultant's candidate_name for a one-person hotlist, or\n\"Hotlist — N consultants\" for a multi-consultant one -- falling back to\nthe stored title column only if the parsed data isn't there. Self-heals\nevery existing draft immediately, no backfill needed, and stays correct\ngoing forward even after a reviewer edits the title field post-intake.\nWired into both the list table and the detail page header; the list's\nsearch box now also matches against the live title, not the stale\nstored one.\n\nFrontend-only change (no backend). Type-checks and builds clean.","timestamp":"2026-08-29T22:46:25-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder/hermes/commit/25853deffe7426cea05535914b56c8a9a2dda1c7","author":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-29T22:46:25-04:00"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-29T22:46:25-04:00"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["frontend/src/components/DraftTypeLabel.tsx","frontend/src/pages/DraftDetailPage.tsx","frontend/src/pages/DraftListPage.tsx"]}],"head_commit":{"id":"25853deffe7426cea05535914b56c8a9a2dda1c7","tree_id":"d4d469a163b8379b1b27b983cd193b03954ba5a3","distinct":true,"message":"feat(review): show the actual job title/candidate name in the drafts list, not \"Draft Job Requirement\"\n\nThe list and detail pages both rendered the drafts.title column\nverbatim. That column is a one-time snapshot taken at intake (or a\nreclassify) from _title_from_payload -- which for every draft created\nbefore the earlier job-title-generation fix, and any draft whose\njob_title/candidate_name field gets corrected afterward via inline\nediting, is stuck on the generic \"Draft Job Requirement\"/\"Draft\nHotlist\" fallback with no way to refresh short of a backend backfill.\n\ndraftDisplayTitle() (app/components/DraftTypeLabel.tsx) reads the title\nlive from the parsed record instead: job_title for a requirement, the\nsingle consultant's candidate_name for a one-person hotlist, or\n\"Hotlist — N consultants\" for a multi-consultant one -- falling back to\nthe stored title column only if the parsed data isn't there. Self-heals\nevery existing draft immediately, no backfill needed, and stays correct\ngoing forward even after a reviewer edits the title field post-intake.\nWired into both the list table and the detail page header; the list's\nsearch box now also matches against the live title, not the stale\nstored one.\n\nFrontend-only change (no backend). Type-checks and builds clean.","timestamp":"2026-08-29T22:46:25-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder/hermes/commit/25853deffe7426cea05535914b56c8a9a2dda1c7","author":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-29T22:46:25-04:00"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-29T22:46:25-04:00"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["frontend/src/components/DraftTypeLabel.tsx","frontend/src/pages/DraftDetailPage.tsx","frontend/src/pages/DraftListPage.tsx"]}}
